{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0157A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake In状态下保持不动，两个人的心跳就会开始<R=同步,Sync>。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=同步,Sync>","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED; RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"心跳？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":"AUX_MEANING_DRIFT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对。等两人的心跳完全同步，就会进入Snake Sync状态。借助与同伴的协同效应，可以发挥出比平时更大的力量。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":145,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"移动和恢复都会变快，迷彩率也会上升。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"说白了，就是两个人配合得很默契。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"没错。到了关键时刻，先冷静下来同步一下也是个办法。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"刚才也说过，Snake Sync的效果会受到和对方友情度的影响。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":"AUX_TERM_NORMALIZED_TO_JPN"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那当然。和知根知底的人搭档，更能互相掩护死角。这样自己也能更专注于行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"}]}